{
  "about": "What each kind of object offers to the editor's rules (Properties > Interactions): its outputs, what can happen to it, and its inputs, what a rule can make it do. An object's family is the one whose class is its nearest ancestor (editor/logic_catalog.py). outputs: how the game hears each one (editor/LOGIC.md) and the Tag its link waits for ({src}: the object, {option}: a computer's option; none: the link is watched or set off directly). inputs: whether the action needs an object (target). A family's first input is the one a new rule takes. The page's sentences for each id are in static/app.js (LK_WHEN, LK_VERBS).",
  "outputs": {
    "opened": {"hears": "event", "tag": "UCL_{src}"},
    "closed": {"hears": "event", "tag": "UCL_{src}"},
    "destroyed": {"hears": "event", "tag": "UCL_{src}"},
    "used": {"hears": "event", "tag": "UCL_{src}"},
    "code": {"hears": "keypad", "tag": "UCL_{src}"},
    "wrongcode": {"hears": "fail", "tag": "UCL_{src}_Fail"},
    "option": {"hears": "option", "tag": "UCL_{src}_Opt{option}"},
    "enter": {"hears": "event", "tag": "UCL_{src}"},
    "leave": {"hears": "event", "tag": "UCL_{src}"},
    "laser": {"hears": "event", "tag": "UCL_{src}"},
    "alarm": {"hears": "event", "tag": "UCL_{src}"},
    "dies": {"hears": "event", "tag": "UCL_{src}"},
    "any": {"hears": "event", "tag": "UCL_{src}"},
    "picked": {"hears": "watch"},
    "gone": {"hears": "watch"},
    "near": {"hears": "watch"},
    "arrived": {"hears": "watch"},
    "start": {"hears": "start"},
    "animdone": {"hears": "motion", "tag": "UCL_{src}_Anim"},
    "cutstart": {"hears": "cut", "tag": "UCL_{src}_Start"},
    "cutdone": {"hears": "cut", "tag": "UCL_{src}_End"},
    "npcused": {"hears": "npcuse", "tag": "UCL_{src}_Npc"},
    "finished": {"hears": "timer", "tag": "UCL_{src}_Done"},
    "stopped": {"hears": "timer", "tag": "UCL_{src}_Stop"},
    "output": {"hears": "port"}
  },
  "inputs": {
    "open": {"target": true}, "close": {"target": true}, "toggle": {"target": true}, "lock": {"target": true},
    "unlock": {"target": true}, "blow": {"target": true}, "key": {"target": true},
    "attack": {"target": true}, "hostile": {"target": true}, "friend": {"target": true}, "neutral": {"target": true},
    "stand": {"target": true}, "wander": {"target": true}, "follow": {"target": true}, "goto": {"target": true},
    "run": {"target": true}, "leave": {"target": true}, "appear": {"target": true}, "npcuse": {"target": true},
    "lighton": {"target": true}, "lightoff": {"target": true}, "lighttoggle": {"target": true},
    "on": {"target": true}, "off": {"target": true}, "hide": {"target": true}, "show": {"target": true},
    "explode": {"target": false}, "sound": {"target": false}, "effect": {"target": true},
    "anim": {"target": true}, "animback": {"target": true}, "animstop": {"target": true},
    "cutplay": {"target": true}, "cutstop": {"target": true},
    "timerstart": {"target": true}, "timerstop": {"target": true}, "timerpause": {"target": true}, "timerresume": {"target": true},
    "input": {"target": true}, "floor": {"target": true},
    "message": {"target": false}, "goal": {"target": false}, "note": {"target": false}, "flag": {"target": false},
    "count": {"target": false}, "travel": {"target": false}
  },
  "free": ["message", "goal", "note", "flag", "count", "sound", "travel"],
  "families": [
    {"id": "other", "classes": ["Actor"], "outputs": ["any", "npcused", "near"], "inputs": ["on", "off", "sound", "explode", "effect"]},
    {"id": "door", "classes": ["DeusExMover"], "outputs": ["opened", "closed", "destroyed", "near"],
     "inputs": ["open", "close", "toggle", "lock", "unlock", "blow", "key", "sound", "explode", "effect"]},
    {"id": "elevator", "classes": ["ElevatorMover", "MultiMover"], "outputs": ["any", "near"], "inputs": ["floor", "sound", "explode"],
     "note": "They ignore Trigger: SetSeq moves them (floor), as SequenceTrigger does. 'any': it has reached a floor."},
    {"id": "keypad", "classes": ["Keypad"], "outputs": ["code", "wrongcode", "npcused", "near"], "inputs": ["hide", "show", "sound", "explode", "effect"]},
    {"id": "computer", "classes": ["Computers"], "outputs": ["used", "option", "npcused", "near"], "inputs": ["hide", "show", "sound", "explode", "effect"]},
    {"id": "character", "classes": ["ScriptedPawn"], "outputs": ["dies", "arrived", "near"],
     "inputs": ["attack", "hostile", "friend", "neutral", "stand", "wander", "follow", "goto", "run", "leave", "appear", "sound", "npcuse"]},
    {"id": "carcass", "classes": ["DeusExCarcass"], "outputs": ["gone", "near"], "inputs": ["hide", "show", "sound", "explode"],
     "note": "A body fires no event of its own."},
    {"id": "laser", "classes": ["LaserTrigger"], "outputs": ["laser", "near"], "inputs": ["off", "on", "sound"]},
    {"id": "beam", "classes": ["BeamTrigger"], "outputs": ["laser", "near"], "inputs": ["off", "on", "sound"],
     "note": "Not a LaserTrigger: before, it fell in 'zone' and offered 'leave', which it never sends."},
    {"id": "alarm", "classes": ["AlarmUnit"], "outputs": ["alarm", "near"], "inputs": ["on", "off", "sound", "explode", "effect"]},
    {"id": "camera", "classes": ["SecurityCamera"], "outputs": ["near"], "inputs": ["off", "on", "sound", "explode", "effect"],
     "note": "A camera fires no event: it only makes the AI alarm noise."},
    {"id": "turret", "classes": ["AutoTurret"], "outputs": ["near"], "inputs": ["off", "on", "sound", "explode", "effect"]},
    {"id": "soundfx", "classes": ["UCSoundFX"], "outputs": ["enter", "leave"], "inputs": ["on"]},
    {"id": "zone", "classes": ["Trigger"], "outputs": ["enter", "leave"], "inputs": ["on", "off"]},
    {"id": "targettrigger", "classes": ["AllianceTrigger", "OrdersTrigger", "InterpolateTrigger", "SequenceTrigger",
       "UnTrigger", "RevStateTrigger", "ActorAppearTrigger", "AnimTrigger", "AnimTweenBlendTrigger", "ElevatorTrigger",
       "PawnAppearTrigger", "PhysicsTrigger", "SkinColourTrigger", "TriggerTrigger", "UnlitTrigger"],
     "outputs": ["near"], "inputs": ["on"],
     "note": "Their Event is a list of targets, not an output: hooking it would break them (UCLink.AimsItsEvent). Revision's MoreTriggers are each named: the editor may not know their chain."},
    {"id": "switchtrigger", "classes": ["DamageTriggerDirect", "LOSHateTrigger"], "outputs": ["near"], "inputs": ["on", "off"],
     "note": "Revision's: their Event is their targets too, and they are switched off (UnTrigger)."},
    {"id": "moretrigger", "classes": ["MoreTriggers", "ActorDestroyTrigger", "CreditsTrigger", "EnergyTrigger",
       "ExplosionTrigger", "FlaggedActorTrigger", "FragmentTrigger", "HealthTrigger", "OrderPawnTrigger", "PawnSpawnTrigger",
       "RandomTrigger", "SetGoalTrigger", "SheepsGiveItemTrigger", "SpawnTrigger"],
     "outputs": ["leave", "near"], "inputs": ["on"],
     "note": "Revision's other MoreTriggers: they never send their Event when JC walks in, only untrigger it when he walks out."},
    {"id": "light", "classes": ["Light"], "outputs": [], "inputs": ["lighttoggle", "lighton", "lightoff"]},
    {"id": "switchlight", "classes": ["AlarmLight", "CageLight"], "outputs": ["used", "gone", "near"],
     "inputs": ["on", "off", "hide", "show", "sound", "explode", "effect"]},
    {"id": "item", "classes": ["Inventory"], "outputs": ["picked", "near"], "inputs": ["hide", "show", "sound", "explode", "effect"]},
    {"id": "object", "classes": ["DeusExDecoration"], "outputs": ["used", "gone", "npcused", "near"], "inputs": ["hide", "show", "sound", "explode", "effect"]},
    {"id": "timer", "classes": ["UCTimer"], "outputs": ["finished", "stopped"], "inputs": ["timerstart", "timerstop", "timerpause", "timerresume"]},
    {"id": "cutscene", "classes": ["UCCutscene"], "outputs": ["cutstart", "cutdone"], "inputs": ["cutplay", "cutstop"]},
    {"id": "effectpoint", "classes": ["UCEffectPoint"], "outputs": ["near"], "inputs": ["effect"]},
    {"id": "script", "classes": ["UCScript"], "outputs": ["near"], "inputs": ["on", "off", "sound", "explode", "effect"],
     "note": "Its declared outputs and inputs (Tools > Scripts, editor/scripts.py ports) come first."}
  ]
}
